# Root build-context ignore (Chunk 9.1). The api/worker/web production images build with the
# repo ROOT as context (they need pnpm-workspace.yaml + the lockfile + sibling workspace packages),
# so THIS file is the one Docker actually honors for those builds. The per-app .dockerignore files
# document intent and apply only if an app is built with its own dir as context. apps/ml builds with
# its own context and has its own .dockerignore.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage

# VCS / editor / OS cruft
.git
.gitignore
**/.DS_Store
.vscode
.idea

# Secrets & local env — never bake into an image
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ml has its own image + context; we only need its manifest for the frozen pnpm workspace install
apps/ml/*
!apps/ml/package.json
docs
**/test
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.log
.github
.claude
*.md
